course: dictionary
lesson: 8839
title: Shipper: the sender and the fan
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A shipper is a person or company that sends goods from one place to another. Goods are things that are bought and sold, like fruit, toys or parcels.
explain: «Ripe fruit gives off ethylene gas, which makes nearby fruit ripen, and shippers keep bananas cold and away from it on long trips.» The clues are long trips, keeping bananas cold, and keeping them away from the gas. So the shippers are the people who send the bananas somewhere, and they take care of them on the way.
explain: Context helps you choose the right meaning. Online, a fan can also be called a shipper. A fan who «ships» two characters, from «relationship», wants them to be a couple. Same word, different meaning: read the words around it to find out which one is meant.
fact: A shipper sends goods from one place to another.
fact: Shippers can send goods by sea, by air, by road or by rail.
fact: A shipper can be a person or a company.
fact: «Shipper» is informal for a fan who supports two characters in a story as a couple.
fact: In the banana sentence, «ethylene» is a gas that makes fruit ripen.
exercise: «Shippers keep bananas cold and away from ethylene gas on long trips.» Who are the shippers in this sentence? | Cooks who make banana cake | *People or companies who send the bananas to other places | Fruit that goes bad in the sun | Monkeys who climb banana trees
exercise: What does a shipper do? | Grows goods on a farm | Sells goods only in one shop | Stops goods from moving | *Sends goods from one place to another
exercise: A fan says, «I ship Ana and Ben from the show.» What does ship mean here? | To draw a map of the show | *To support them as a couple | To fix a broken boat | To send them by sea
test: Which of these is a shipper? | *A company that sends parcels bought online | A road that goes through a town | A bird that sings at dawn | A small shop on the corner
test: In «shippers keep bananas cold and away from ethylene gas on long trips», which word means a gas that makes fruit ripen? | shippers | bananas | trips | *ethylene
exam: A company sends a box of toys by air to a shop in another country. Which word best names that company? | *Shipper | Baker | Gardener | Fan
</br>
